business_rules.rule:
`PATCH /api/rewards/{reward}` con `reward_status_id`: 403 senza `rewarded-referents.update`;
422 se `reward_status_id` non esiste o non e' attivo (D-7); rispetta il field-permission del
campo `reward_status` (utente con campo readonly => 403/422, non salva).

data_contract.migration:
1) `foreignId('reward_status_id')->nullable()->after('reward_type_id')->constrained('reward_statuses')->restrictOnDelete()`;
2) backfill: UPDATE rewards SET reward_status_id = (id di system_key='pending');
3) `->change()` a NOT NULL. `down()` reversibile. index su `reward_status_id`.

constraints.item:
`#[Fillable([...])]` su RewardStatus (`name,description,color,sort_order,is_active` — NON
      system_key) e su Reward (+`reward_status_id`); `casts()` metodo (`sort_order:int, is_active:bool`);
      estende BaseModel + LogsModelActivity.
